{
  "schema": "2.0",
  "config": {
    "update_multi": true,
    "style": {
      "text_size": {
        "normal_v2": {
          "default": "normal",
          "pc": "normal",
          "mobile": "heading"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "header": {
    "title": {
      "tag": "plain_text",
      "content": "提问 [3/3]"
    },
    "subtitle": {
      "tag": "plain_text",
      "content": "回滚预案"
    },
    "template": "turquoise",
    "padding": "12px 8px 12px 8px"
  },
  "body": {
    "direction": "vertical",
    "vertical_spacing": "4px",
    "elements": [
      {
        "tag": "form",
        "name": "q_form_3",
        "elements": [
          {
            "tag": "markdown",
            "content": "新脚本万一把 CI 挂了，先回滚还是先热修？",
            "text_size": "normal"
          },
          {
            "tag": "markdown",
            "content": "<font color='grey'>选一个，或在下面自己写；自己写的优先</font>",
            "text_size": "notation"
          },
          {
            "tag": "select_static",
            "placeholder": {
              "tag": "plain_text",
              "content": "选择"
            },
            "options": [
              {
                "text": {
                  "tag": "plain_text",
                  "content": "直接回滚到上一版"
                },
                "value": "revert"
              },
              {
                "text": {
                  "tag": "plain_text",
                  "content": "先热修，超过 30 分钟没头绪再回滚"
                },
                "value": "hotfix"
              },
              {
                "text": {
                  "tag": "plain_text",
                  "content": "停住流水线，等你看过再说"
                },
                "value": "freeze"
              }
            ],
            "type": "default",
            "width": "fill",
            "required": false,
            "name": "sel_3"
          },
          {
            "tag": "input",
            "name": "custom_3",
            "placeholder": {
              "tag": "plain_text",
              "content": "或者自己写…"
            },
            "default_value": "",
            "width": "fill",
            "max_length": 200,
            "required": false
          },
          {
            "tag": "column_set",
            "flex_mode": "none",
            "horizontal_spacing": "8px",
            "columns": [
              {
                "tag": "column",
                "width": "weighted",
                "vertical_align": "center",
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "tag": "button",
                    "text": {
                      "tag": "plain_text",
                      "content": "🚫 取消"
                    },
                    "type": "danger",
                    "width": "fill",
                    "form_action_type": "submit",
                    "name": "btn_deny"
                  }
                ],
                "weight": 1
              },
              {
                "tag": "column",
                "width": "weighted",
                "vertical_align": "center",
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "tag": "button",
                    "text": {
                      "tag": "plain_text",
                      "content": "✅ 提交本题"
                    },
                    "type": "primary_filled",
                    "width": "fill",
                    "form_action_type": "submit",
                    "name": "btn_answer"
                  }
                ],
                "weight": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "<font color='grey'>ask-preview · sess-1 · 至 12:30</font>",
        "text_size": "notation",
        "margin": "6px 0px 0px 0px"
      }
    ]
  }
}
